# Dsquares Loyalty API

## Requirements
- .NET 10 SDK

## Run
dotnet restore
dotnet run --project Dsquares.LoyaltyApi

## Test
dotnet test

## Endpoints
- POST /awards
- GET /wallets/{walletId}

## Initial data
- W100: 100 points
- W200: 50 points

## Design
- Award identity: (sourceId, externalTransactionId).
- Matching retries return the original award.
- Conflicting retries return 409.
- One in-process lock protects award creation and balance updates.
- Data is in memory and resets on restart.

## Reset
Use the "Wallets/Reset" Request.

## Limitations
- No persistence across restarts.
- Lock coordinates only one process.
- Not designed for multiple application instances.
